config BR2_PACKAGE_KIWAMI_LIBRETRO_GENESIS_PLUS_GX
	bool "kiwami-libretro-genesis-plus-gx"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_RETROARCH
	help
	  Genesis Plus GX, the Mega Drive, accurate (its sound in particular): a second core for the Mega Drive,
	  chosen in Settings > Other systems > Mega Drive. Upstream's PicoDrive stays the default.

	  https://github.com/libretro/Genesis-Plus-GX
